        "content": "<p>did a Palomar submission for <a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids\">https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids</a> <br>\nand got this:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"n\">an</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">independent</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">failed</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">or</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rejected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">proof</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">that</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Lean's</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">accepted</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">ron</span>\n<span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">ron</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">kernel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rejected</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">solution</span>\n<span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">ron</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fuel</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exhausted</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">whnf</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">loop</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"k\">at</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">theorem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ConjectureMachines</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Zf380</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">boot_cand</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fold</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">position</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">8212</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"c1\">--verified) t=15.690s</span>\n<span class=\"n\">error</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">con</span><span class=\"bp\">-</span><span class=\"n\">ron</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">exited</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">with</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">3</span>\n<span class=\"n\">Palomar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">must</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">fix</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"n\">Next</span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Do</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">change</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repository</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Palomar</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">must</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">examine</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">this</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"bp\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">report</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">the</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">workflow</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">URL</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>this is the run: <br>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/PalomarRegistry/PalomarSubmission/actions/runs/38359497131/job/115170110043\">https://github.com/PalomarRegistry/PalomarSubmission/actions/runs/38359497131/job/115170110043</a></p>\n<p>The cause seems to be in <code>ConjectureMachines.Zf380.boot_cand</code> (at commit <a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids/commit/5c6588975b59472d7d4a2d6c4506f80bd86f03ca\">https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids/commit/5c6588975b59472d7d4a2d6c4506f80bd86f03ca</a>, config <code>comparator/all.json</code>), a <code>dsimp only</code> before <code>rw</code> left a definitional equality between <code>runFast candM 39734 (stateOfBootCand .b0) ...</code> and <code>runFast candM 39734 0 ...</code>, causing <code>con-ron</code> (<code>v4.35.0-rc4</code>) to delta-unfold all 39,734 steps of <code>runFast</code> inside <code>whnf_loop</code>.</p>\n<p>It looks like this is already fixed on <code>con-ron</code> <code>master</code> in <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover/con-ron/commit/a204258115d214f53548dd3aba2d8cf22e91724b\">https://github.com/leanprover/con-ron/commit/a204258115d214f53548dd3aba2d8cf22e91724b</a> (<code>#333</code> <code>defeq_unreduced</code> before <code>whnf</code> and <code>#330</code> bumping <code>WHNF_LOOP_FUEL</code> to <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>62</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^{62}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">62</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>). In the meantime we left <code>5c65889</code> intact on <code>main</code> and worked around it in <a href=\"https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids/commit/b1e458ea8dd2e35224c63bed6d563260ea9fba32\">https://github.com/google-deepmind/cryptids/commit/b1e458ea8dd2e35224c63bed6d563260ea9fba32</a> by marking <code>runFast</code> <code>[irreducible]</code> and rewriting explicitly, which <code>con-ron</code> accepts (<code>69892 declarations (--verified)</code>), at least locally now re-submitting with that commit.</p>",
